// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, T1546.003, persistence
// Description: Detects file writes of WMI script event consumer
// False positives:
//   - Dell Power Manager (C:\Program Files\Dell\PowerManager\DpmPowerPlanSetup.exe)
// References:
//   - https://web.archive.org/web/20250427230247/https://www.eideon.com/2018-03-02-THL03-WMIBackdoors/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/cb982537eb7397f93785ec066cce7b017050a43f/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_wmi_persistence_script_event_consumer_write.yml
